---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const description = "Why this site exists, and who's writing it.";
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description={description}>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>
    I'm Vedant — a BCom student preparing for the UPSC Civil Services
    Examination, with a long-term interest in public service.
  </p>

  <p>
    This site is where I think in public: about Indian politics, society,
    history, economics, and the ideas that shape how we understand all of
    it. It isn't a news site, and it isn't a notes repository. It's closer
    to a journal — an attempt to build a body of independent, evidence-based
    writing over several years.
  </p>

  <p>
    I try to distinguish between what's fact, what's my interpretation of
    that fact, what's simply my opinion, and what I genuinely don't know
    yet. I'd rather sit with a hard question than force a tidy answer onto
    it.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you're reading this and have thoughts, corrections, or disagreements
    — I'd like to hear them. See the <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
